{"id":"huntik:page:2739","page_id":2739,"title":"Seine River","kind":"location","namespace":0,"summary":"The Seine River is located in Rouen, France. It is here that Peter saved two people from a whirlpool caused by the emerging power of the Titan, Gar-Ghoul. Later, Peter, Dante Vale, Sophie Casterwill, Lok Lambert, and Zhalia Moon rode a boat down the river looking for clues about Gar-Ghoul. When whirlpools, caused by Gar-Ghoul, began to attack them, they flew off of the boat and stumbled across the Cave of the Gargoyle. [Into the River of Secrets]","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S1E04 Seine River 2.png","wikitext":"File:S1E04 Seine River 2.png","links":[]},"type":{"text":"River","wikitext":"River","links":[]},"level":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"location":{"text":"Rouen, France","wikitext":"[[Rouen, France]]","links":[{"target_title":"Rouen, France","label":"Rouen, France","target_id":"huntik:page:8236","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rouen%2C_France","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Rouen%2C%20France"}]},"inhabitants":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox location","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:S1E04 Seine River 2.png","value_text":"File:S1E04 Seine River 2.png","links":[]},{"name":"type","value_wikitext":"River","value_text":"River","links":[]},{"name":"level","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"location","value_wikitext":"[[Rouen, France]]","value_text":"Rouen, France","links":[{"target_title":"Rouen, France","label":"Rouen, France","target_id":"huntik:page:8236","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rouen%2C_France","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Rouen%2C%20France"}]},{"name":"inhabitants","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]}],"start":0,"end":156}],"sections":[],"full_text":"The Seine River is located in Rouen, France. It is here that Peter saved two people from a whirlpool caused by the emerging power of the Titan, Ga